# Netrunner — product

Platform defaults: `app-core`, `app-aws-regions`, `app-observability` (see `.cursor/rules/README.md`).

- **Product**: classic Netrunner card catalog with random starters/boosters (cards-only; no auth).
- **Delivery**: static site only under `netrunner/` — HTML, CSS, plain JS. No framework, bundler, package manager, or build step for the site. Tests under `tests/` gate deploy.
- **Agents**: `AGENTS.md`, `README.md`, `docs/adr/`, `SECURITY.md`. Prefer small diffs.
